# M6 flow (D-047, D-097, D-098; a D-101 acceptance condition): the end of
# the playable journey on the real route. Title flow with the run started
# in Strobl: the flow_m6_strobl_to_bad_ischl inputs to the start of Bad
# Ischl play (2942: score 17300, lives 3, 34 Oblaten carried over), then
# the inputs of bad_ischl_solver.replay (Bad Ischl clear at 4793, the
# goal sequence past the queue at Café Zauner), then idle: the tally, the
# route map Bad Ischl -> Café Zauner (5279; the walk from 5319, primary
# label slots on this screen per D-098), which has no level yet, so the
# teaser („Fortsetzung folgt …", 5343-5522) and the title (5523) with
# the run reset to its first stage (Strobl), Normal, score 0, lives 3.
# Shot: the map walk to Café Zauner (5330). D-102 (E42): Strobl 230 s and
# Bad Ischl 210 s shorten the tallies (10 and 60 frames), 10 idle frames
# fewer before Bad Ischl, the re-solved Bad Ischl route; the shot moved
# from 5400 to the same point of the walk. The teaser itself is
# bad_ischl_tour's `teaser` shot (Normal) and flow_m6_hackl_bad_ischl_teaser's
# (Hackl).
level  = strobl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1900..1900 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt
expect = event=LevelComplete state=title stage=strobl power=normal score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0
shots  = 5330:map_walk
